OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThere will be a mixture of
OL,6,Fbright spells and a few showers coming
OL,7,Fthrough from the west. It will feel
OL,8,Fquite cool with a brisk westerly
OL,9,Fbreeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FBright spells and scattered
OL,12,Fshowers in the evening. Largely cloud
OL,13,Fovernight with further showers, these
OL,14,Fmost frequent across Orkney. Winds
OL,15,Fbecoming light.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FRather cloudy with bright
OL,18,Fintervals and a few showers. Still
OL,19,Ffeeling rather cool with a light
OL,20,Fnorthwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
